cff-version: 1.2.0
message: libFLAC, vendored in tools/av1mkv (the library only).
title: FLAC (libFLAC)
abstract: >-
  libFLAC from V-Sekai-fire/flac at tag 1.5.0 (1507800de4b70e21be71f38caa0d9079d0bc6e45),
  a fork of xiph/flac, stripped to the BSD-licensed library: include/FLAC, the share
  headers libFLAC includes, src/libFLAC and src/share/win_utf8_io, with the CMake files
  trimmed to build it alone. The flac and metaflac programs, the tests, libFLAC++ and the
  GPL and LGPL share/ helpers are not in this tree.
authors:
  - name: Xiph.Org Foundation
repository-code: https://github.com/V-Sekai-fire/flac
commit: 1507800de4b70e21be71f38caa0d9079d0bc6e45
